WEBVTT

00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:11.160
Marilyn the Tri-Horn Demi-Dragon...

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:15.330
Talk about a great reward!
What'd you do to earn that?

00:00:15.330 --> 00:00:17.750
I did some modeling for an artist.

00:00:17.750 --> 00:00:20.870
There were a few different
rewards to choose from;

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:24.500
I picked one that would put my
Monster Enhance skill to good use.

00:00:25.660 --> 00:00:28.160
I got this, too.

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:32.080
It's called a Jewel,
and it lets you store monsters.

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:35.120
Oh, right! I nearly forgot to tell you:

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:39.370
My Journalist skill boosts the entire
party's experience points.

00:00:39.370 --> 00:00:42.120
The tradeoff? I can't fight. At all.

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:43.040
Huh?

00:00:43.040 --> 00:00:45.790
So do your best, 'kay?

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:49.830
Master, look!

00:00:56.790 --> 00:00:59.080
They're outnumbered--overwhelmed.

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:00.910
What now?

00:01:00.910 --> 00:01:04.660
Just leaving them to die
doesn't sit well with me.

00:01:04.660 --> 00:01:09.540
The penalty for dying might mean
we fail our quest, but...

00:01:09.540 --> 00:01:11.040
Let's do it.

00:01:16.910 --> 00:01:19.330
Marilyn! Run them over!

00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:25.450
Wow!

00:01:25.450 --> 00:01:27.870
C'mon, Ray!

00:01:27.870 --> 00:01:29.120
Yeah!

00:01:35.290 --> 00:01:36.000
Male!

00:01:36.000 --> 00:01:36.580
"Male"

00:01:36.580 --> 00:01:37.370
Lilim!

00:01:37.370 --> 00:01:38.000
"Lilim"

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:39.660
--Temptation!
--Temptation!

00:01:39.660 --> 00:01:40.870
"Male Temptation"
"Lilim Temptation"

00:01:52.660 --> 00:01:54.450
It's like a bad dream.

00:01:54.450 --> 00:01:57.080
Good thing we're on the same side.

00:01:58.500 --> 00:02:00.750
Lilim Drain!

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:08.120
Thanks for the snack!

00:02:08.120 --> 00:02:12.290
Rook! Rook! Babi's Second Form now!

00:02:12.290 --> 00:02:13.370
Really?

00:02:13.370 --> 00:02:16.330
Well, when you take out that many enemies...

00:02:16.330 --> 00:02:20.040
You and I are made for one-on-one combat,

00:02:20.040 --> 00:02:24.910
but the way they mow down crowds
of foes makes them a real deadly duo.

00:02:24.910 --> 00:02:28.370
Babi got the Drain Learning skill!

00:02:28.370 --> 00:02:30.700
You're traveling Masters, I see.

00:02:30.700 --> 00:02:34.040
If you hadn't arrived, we would have been dead.

00:02:34.040 --> 00:02:37.700
Oh, it wasn't me. Rook and his--

00:02:41.660 --> 00:02:43.540
Counter Absorption!

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:47.750
This thing's even more powerful
than those rotten bugs!

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:50.120
Be careful, Ray!

00:02:50.120 --> 00:02:53.950
That there is a UBM: A Unique Boss Monster!

00:02:53.950 --> 00:02:55.750
Master, that's...

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:59.370
Right: The bountied boss from that list...

00:02:59.370 --> 00:03:03.120
...the Great Miasmic Ogre, Gardranda!

00:03:00.250 --> 00:03:03.120
"Great Miasmic Ogre, Gardranda"

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:37.500
"Chapter 4: Like a
 Flag Flying the Reversal"

00:04:35.870 --> 00:04:38.830
So you're the boss of those Goblins, huh?

00:04:38.830 --> 00:04:41.330
You must be mad that they got wiped out.

00:04:41.330 --> 00:04:43.750
But the idea of us getting killed?

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:46.080
That leaves a bad taste in my mouth!

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:50.830
Ray! Fall back!

00:04:55.540 --> 00:04:57.870
Oof... Huff...

00:04:57.870 --> 00:04:59.120
Ray!

00:05:04.410 --> 00:05:07.910
"Ray Starling"

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:07.910
"Poison"

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:07.910
"Intoxication"

00:05:05.500 --> 00:05:07.910
"Weakness"

00:05:21.250 --> 00:05:22.620
Marilyn!

00:05:25.950 --> 00:05:27.910
Get 'em, Marilyn!

00:05:41.450 --> 00:05:42.750
Re-Call!

00:05:47.950 --> 00:05:50.160
Lilim Temptation!

00:05:52.450 --> 00:05:54.200
It's not working!

00:05:56.620 --> 00:05:58.410
Ray!

00:05:58.410 --> 00:06:01.000
Don't toy with me!

00:06:01.000 --> 00:06:03.580
Vengeance is Mine!

00:06:06.660 --> 00:06:09.750
Guess it's not charged up enough yet.

00:06:10.750 --> 00:06:12.620
First Heal!

00:06:13.580 --> 00:06:19.540
I can offset the HP loss from the Poison,
but the Intoxication and the Weakness...

00:06:19.540 --> 00:06:20.870
Ray!

00:06:24.870 --> 00:06:26.910
What the hell was <i>that</i> ?!

00:06:26.910 --> 00:06:29.950
Rub salt in my wounds, why don't you!

00:06:32.250 --> 00:06:34.500
"Poison"

00:06:32.620 --> 00:06:36.950
"Elixir | Effective Period"

00:06:34.500 --> 00:06:36.950
Just an Elixir I'd been holding onto!

00:06:36.950 --> 00:06:41.120
You'll be free of all status
ailments for 180 seconds!

00:06:41.120 --> 00:06:42.870
Thanks a lot!

00:06:42.870 --> 00:06:47.290
If you're fighting healthy,
he'll barely be tougher than those bugs.

00:06:47.290 --> 00:06:49.910
There's still hope--if I can just hold out!

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:59.370
Tch. Nicked him!

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:06.580
First Heal!

00:07:09.580 --> 00:07:14.040
I take about 660 damage from each hit.

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:19.830
"Ray Starling"

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:19.830
First Heal!

00:07:19.830 --> 00:07:24.200
Seven hits in the time
I've got adds up to 4,620.

00:07:24.200 --> 00:07:28.750
Vengeance is Mine will do twice that:
9,240 points of damage!

00:07:28.750 --> 00:07:29.500
I can do this!

00:07:29.500 --> 00:07:31.540
Master! Strafe!

00:07:35.910 --> 00:07:38.250
"Crimson Roc Bird"
"Mount of: Great Miasmic Ogre, Gardranda"

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:38.250
A Crimson Roc Bird?!

00:07:38.250 --> 00:07:43.080
A mount? Aha--so that's how
the ogre just came out of the sky.

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:48.370
Dammit. At this rate...

00:07:48.370 --> 00:07:49.660
Ray!

00:07:50.620 --> 00:07:55.160
We'll handle the Roc Bird.
You concentrate on Gardranda!

00:07:55.160 --> 00:07:56.830
Leave it to Flyin' Babi!

00:07:56.830 --> 00:07:58.370
Rook, you two are no match for--

00:07:58.370 --> 00:08:02.000
We'll buy you time to take that boss down!

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:04.200
Don't worry about us!

00:08:04.200 --> 00:08:07.580
You can't let their kindness
go to waste, Master.

00:08:07.580 --> 00:08:08.330
Right.

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:11.080
"Ray Starling"

00:08:08.330 --> 00:08:11.080
"Elixir | Effective Period"

00:08:09.040 --> 00:08:11.500
Fifty-seven seconds left.

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:16.540
If I minimize recovery, I can
take three, maybe four blows.

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:18.000
Yeah!

00:08:18.000 --> 00:08:23.540
We can only fight like this
because Marie used her Elixir.

00:08:23.540 --> 00:08:27.160
Because Rook and Babi
are holding back the Roc Bird.

00:08:27.160 --> 00:08:31.450
Nemesis and I aren't fighting alone out here!

00:08:31.450 --> 00:08:33.700
Right now...

00:08:33.700 --> 00:08:36.000
...we're fighting as a party!

00:08:37.410 --> 00:08:39.290
Ten seconds left.

00:08:40.330 --> 00:08:41.910
Nemesis!

00:08:41.910 --> 00:08:45.000
Accumulated damage: 4,973 points.

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:47.580
We can do this, Master!

00:08:47.580 --> 00:08:51.040
Take <i>that</i> !

00:08:56.330 --> 00:08:59.500
Heck, take all of this together!

00:08:59.500 --> 00:09:02.620
Counter Absorption!

00:09:02.620 --> 00:09:05.410
Double payback!

00:09:05.410 --> 00:09:07.910
Vengeance is Mine!

00:09:15.700 --> 00:09:17.000
Ray!

00:09:19.200 --> 00:09:21.120
First Heal...

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:27.160
"Poison"

00:09:23.290 --> 00:09:27.160
"Intoxication"

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:27.160
"Weakness"

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:27.160
The Elixir must have worn off.

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:31.120
What's going on? I was sure we destroyed it!

00:09:31.120 --> 00:09:34.410
We destroyed the heart--I know that much.

00:09:34.410 --> 00:09:36.040
The heart!

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:39.660
The ogre's heart is in its stomach.

00:09:39.660 --> 00:09:42.500
So that's how it is.

00:09:42.500 --> 00:09:48.200
But now that I know... so what?
My strength is practically gone.

00:09:49.830 --> 00:09:52.120
No--no, it's not!

00:09:52.120 --> 00:09:53.620
Not yet.

00:09:53.620 --> 00:09:59.330
My friends haven't given up--how can I?

00:09:59.330 --> 00:10:02.700
Just watch: I'll push past my limits!

00:10:02.700 --> 00:10:05.580
I'll grab the possibility of victory!

00:10:05.580 --> 00:10:06.580
Master!

00:10:06.580 --> 00:10:10.290
The odds will be against us
in this fight, Nemesis.

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:11.790
Will you stay with me?

00:10:11.790 --> 00:10:14.000
Yes, of course, but...

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:18.200
I just wanted to mention that beeping.
It's been going on for a while.

00:10:18.200 --> 00:10:18.750
Huh?

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:21.160
"Ray Starling"

00:10:18.750 --> 00:10:21.160
"Poison"

00:10:21.830 --> 00:10:24.200
What <i>is</i> all this, Nemesis?

00:10:24.200 --> 00:10:27.000
I don't know, either!

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:27.870
"If you wish to cancel,
please do so within the next 20 seconds"

00:10:27.000 --> 00:10:29.870
What do I do? Cancel it?

00:10:28.410 --> 00:10:31.000
"Do you wish to cancel?"

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:38.250
I've been spotted!

00:10:39.450 --> 00:10:42.870
Seriously? I'm kind of in
the middle of something here!

00:10:44.950 --> 00:10:48.750
This just means I'll have to bet
it all where the possibility lies!

00:10:49.700 --> 00:10:51.330
Countdown complete.

00:10:51.330 --> 00:10:56.250
Confirming intent to commence emergency
***** evolution process.

00:10:56.250 --> 00:11:00.200
Utilizing 172 patterns to calculate
optimal solution to current situation

00:11:00.200 --> 00:11:05.250
and commencing emergency evolution
of the Maiden of Vengeance, Nemesis.

00:11:09.410 --> 00:11:12.620
***** complete.

00:11:12.620 --> 00:11:16.200
Form 2: The Flag Halberd.

00:11:23.910 --> 00:11:25.500
Jump, Master!

00:11:31.000 --> 00:11:33.290
What's going on, Nemesis?

00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:34.870
Master...

00:11:34.870 --> 00:11:38.200
I seem to have evolved into my Second Form.

00:11:38.200 --> 00:11:42.080
The power I feel within is greater than ever.

00:11:44.620 --> 00:11:49.660
Nemesis... how great <i>is</i> this power, exactly?

00:11:49.660 --> 00:11:53.370
Victory over that rotten ogre
is within our grasp!

00:11:53.370 --> 00:11:55.450
Just what I wanted to hear!

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:02.410
Let the final round begin!

00:12:15.120 --> 00:12:17.410
My movements are so much sharper than usual.

00:12:17.410 --> 00:12:20.830
My HP keeps refilling, too.

00:12:20.830 --> 00:12:22.830
What <i>is</i> all this?

00:12:22.830 --> 00:12:25.330
This is my new skill:

00:12:23.700 --> 00:12:30.000
"Poison: Continuous HP drain --&gt;
Continuous HP recovery"

00:12:25.330 --> 00:12:30.000
Like a Flag Flying the Reversal,
which reverses all status ailments.

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.660
"Weakness: Lowered stats --&gt; Increased stats"
"Intoxication: Paralyzed senses --&gt; Sharpened senses"

00:12:30.000 --> 00:12:32.660
Seems awfully convenient, if you ask me.

00:12:32.660 --> 00:12:37.790
So this is what that announcement
meant about an "optimal solution."

00:12:37.790 --> 00:12:41.620
But I'm going all in on this possibility!

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:43.660
No argument here!

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:54.330
This miasma is nothing but
a smokescreen to me now!

00:12:59.290 --> 00:13:02.040
I knew it: Its weak point was its belly!

00:13:03.080 --> 00:13:06.620
Apparently its weak points are
the only parts that can regenerate.

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:12.120
So there's no point timidly chipping away at it.
I'll charge up and use Vengeance to--

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:14.160
A word of warning...

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:18.950
Counter Absorption and Vengeance is Mine
are not usable in this form.

00:13:18.950 --> 00:13:22.200
We've gone through all our Counter
Absorption uses anyway, right?

00:13:22.200 --> 00:13:25.660
No. Now that I've evolved,
we can use it three times.

00:13:25.660 --> 00:13:27.330
We have one more chance.

00:13:27.330 --> 00:13:31.290
You'd have to go back to your
sword form to use either skill.

00:13:31.290 --> 00:13:34.540
But when I do, Like a Flag
Flying the Reversal will--

00:13:34.540 --> 00:13:38.290
It'll wear off, and I'll be hobbled again.

00:13:38.290 --> 00:13:42.410
I'll just have to hobble the ogre, then!

00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:06.620
3,250.

00:14:06.620 --> 00:14:09.450
3,784!

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:12.080
4,265! Master!

00:14:12.080 --> 00:14:13.750
Let's finish this!

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:31.580
Nemesis!

00:14:31.580 --> 00:14:34.330
Form Shift: Black Blade!

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:38.080
"Poison"

00:14:36.330 --> 00:14:38.080
"Intoxication"

00:14:36.580 --> 00:14:38.080
"Weakness"

00:14:39.410 --> 00:14:41.750
Like I give a damn!

00:14:45.620 --> 00:14:47.790
Counter Absorption!

00:14:47.790 --> 00:14:49.750
This is nothing!

00:14:56.200 --> 00:14:58.000
Dual blows?

00:14:58.000 --> 00:15:01.450
This thing saw our attack coming!

00:15:08.580 --> 00:15:11.000
Vengeance is Mine!

00:15:19.790 --> 00:15:22.200
We... did it...

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:24.200
We sure did!

00:15:25.580 --> 00:15:30.160
UBM Great Miasmic Ogre,
Gardranda has been slain.

00:15:30.160 --> 00:15:33.040
Ray Starling selected as MVP.

00:15:33.040 --> 00:15:37.450
Presented with Miasmaflame Bracers, Gardranda.

00:15:37.450 --> 00:15:40.410
Are you all right?

00:15:40.410 --> 00:15:43.040
Here: Some first aid.

00:15:47.580 --> 00:15:52.370
Hey, was there a Superior Killer
around here earlier?

00:15:52.370 --> 00:15:54.330
Oh, right! I saw that!

00:15:54.330 --> 00:15:57.290
A man, firing off his Embryo from the distance.

00:15:57.290 --> 00:16:00.580
He left toward Gideon pretty quickly, though.

00:16:00.580 --> 00:16:02.080
I see.

00:16:02.080 --> 00:16:04.700
Ray! Marie!

00:16:10.910 --> 00:16:12.700
Did you make it okay?

00:16:12.700 --> 00:16:13.830
Eh?

00:16:16.160 --> 00:16:18.700
This is my Roc Bird, Audrey.

00:16:21.620 --> 00:16:24.330
If you've named it, that must mean...

00:16:24.330 --> 00:16:28.750
Yep: Once the miasma cleared,
I Charmed her, then tamed her!

00:16:28.750 --> 00:16:31.450
So it's a she, then?

00:16:31.450 --> 00:16:34.410
Begging your pardon. A moment?

00:16:37.250 --> 00:16:41.790
My family and I would
all be dead if not for you.

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:45.000
Thank you--thank you so very much!

00:16:45.000 --> 00:16:47.660
Please, don't mention it.

00:16:57.830 --> 00:16:59.000
What's that?

00:17:01.500 --> 00:17:06.450
A tian coffin. That's how
they're returned to their family.

00:17:10.330 --> 00:17:12.450
This is too realistic.

00:17:12.450 --> 00:17:15.700
Liliana and Milianne--they're tians.

00:17:15.700 --> 00:17:17.450
And...

00:17:17.450 --> 00:17:19.040
...so is Nemesis.

00:17:20.540 --> 00:17:22.660
Is this really...?

00:17:24.500 --> 00:17:26.910
Is this really a game?

00:17:30.120 --> 00:17:33.660
Hmm? How very mysterious.

00:17:33.660 --> 00:17:38.370
To be able to defeat a UBM
at a higher level than oneself...

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:41.200
A rare instance indeed.

00:17:41.200 --> 00:17:46.750
A group of low-level players comes together,
and this one just happens to deal the final--

00:17:46.750 --> 00:17:48.660
Oho!

00:17:48.660 --> 00:17:54.080
I see. This one has just what
it takes for giant-killing.

00:17:54.080 --> 00:18:02.620
Still, defeating Gardranda, that mass of traps,
before it took on its final form?

00:18:02.620 --> 00:18:09.410
I was sure it would evolve into
the ultimate UBM: An SUBM.

00:18:09.410 --> 00:18:13.660
No matter. This is a joyous occasion.

00:18:13.660 --> 00:18:18.620
If no new powers emerge,
we will never see 100 Superiors--

00:18:18.620 --> 00:18:21.450
and we will not reach Infinity.

00:18:23.250 --> 00:18:27.540
Regardless, you ought to enjoy
yourselves as you grow stronger.

00:18:27.540 --> 00:18:34.450
As far as you're concerned, this world--
from start to finish--is all a game.

00:18:40.370 --> 00:18:41.540
Wow!

00:18:41.540 --> 00:18:44.410
What a lively place!

00:18:44.410 --> 00:18:48.040
It does border Legendaria
and Caldina, after all.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:52.870
They're all friendly nations,
so tourists abound.

00:18:52.870 --> 00:18:56.790
Never mind that--look at all the tasty food!

00:18:56.790 --> 00:18:58.700
Let's grab a bite!

00:18:58.700 --> 00:19:03.040
We will, we will--later. First we need
to hit the Adventurers' Guild.

00:19:07.330 --> 00:19:09.080
What's this?

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:14.790
The advertised 30,000-lir reward for
the delivery quest works out fine, but...

00:19:14.790 --> 00:19:17.330
But?

00:19:17.330 --> 00:19:21.500
But there was a million-lir bounty
on Gardranda's head.

00:19:21.500 --> 00:19:23.750
How do we divvy <i>that</i> up?

00:19:25.540 --> 00:19:29.120
There certainly was a lot
of bickering yesterday.

00:19:29.120 --> 00:19:33.040
Everyone kept trying to take a smaller share.

00:19:33.040 --> 00:19:36.870
You wound up with 300 thousand lir,
Rook with 150 thousand,

00:19:36.870 --> 00:19:38.200
and Marie with 50 thousand.

00:19:38.200 --> 00:19:42.080
The rest went into the party's communal bank.

00:19:42.080 --> 00:19:44.660
I still think my share was too big.

00:19:44.660 --> 00:19:46.700
It's okay to want, Master.

00:19:46.700 --> 00:19:48.870
But I already got these.

00:19:48.870 --> 00:19:52.950
Why don't we give those bracers a whirl?

00:19:54.370 --> 00:19:57.700
The perfect test subject is headed our way.

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:03.410
Here goes: Purgatorial Flames!

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:04.450
Huh?

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:08.790
You idiot! Are you trying to blow yourself up?

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:21.200
I thought I was a goner!

00:20:22.950 --> 00:20:27.540
All right, time to regroup
and try out Hellish Miasma.

00:20:27.540 --> 00:20:29.580
A Walking Grapevine?

00:20:28.750 --> 00:20:30.870
"Walking Grapevine"

00:20:31.120 --> 00:20:32.950
Hellish Miasma!

00:20:38.950 --> 00:20:41.540
Is this some kind of joke?

00:20:41.540 --> 00:20:44.000
I thought I was a goner!

00:20:44.000 --> 00:20:48.160
But now I more or less know
my way around these things.

00:20:48.160 --> 00:20:52.700
Although at this rate,
I'll have to crawl back to town.

00:20:52.700 --> 00:20:54.620
How unseemly.

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:55.620
Huh?!

00:20:55.620 --> 00:20:56.700
Hmm?

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:01.540
Whoa! Who are <i>you</i> ?

00:21:01.540 --> 00:21:04.540
Who am I?

00:21:05.750 --> 00:21:07.660
Hup!

00:21:07.660 --> 00:21:09.790
My name is Fla...

00:21:09.790 --> 00:21:11.330
...mingo!

00:21:11.330 --> 00:21:13.950
That's <i>Doctor</i> Flamingo to you.

00:21:13.950 --> 00:21:16.450
Do only weirdos wear those costumes or what?

00:21:16.450 --> 00:21:19.870
Flamingo? But you're clearly a penguin.

00:21:19.870 --> 00:21:22.660
Details, details!

00:21:22.660 --> 00:21:25.450
Now! You seem to be in a pickle.

00:21:25.450 --> 00:21:28.370
Here. Drinkest thou this.

00:21:28.370 --> 00:21:29.450
What is it?

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:32.000
It's for status ailments.

00:21:32.000 --> 00:21:35.040
One swig and everything will be healed.

00:21:43.620 --> 00:21:44.950
It's delicious!

00:21:48.500 --> 00:21:50.250
Are you okay?

00:21:50.250 --> 00:21:52.750
Yeah--my body feels much better!

00:21:52.750 --> 00:21:54.290
You drank it.

00:21:56.750 --> 00:21:58.750
My head--

00:21:57.450 --> 00:21:58.750
Master!

00:21:58.750 --> 00:22:00.700
What did you give him?!

00:22:05.500 --> 00:22:08.750
Are you all right, Master?

00:22:08.750 --> 00:22:11.750
M-Master! Your head!

00:22:12.700 --> 00:22:14.870
My head?

00:22:14.870 --> 00:22:16.450
Fluffy?

00:22:24.830 --> 00:22:26.200
Huh?!

00:22:26.200 --> 00:22:28.950
What the <i>hell</i> ?!

00:22:30.910 --> 00:22:32.620
What a rousing success!

00:22:32.620 --> 00:22:34.910
My Animal Ear Drug is complete!

00:22:34.910 --> 00:22:38.700
You have my gratitude, my little guinea pig!

00:22:38.700 --> 00:22:43.700
Apologies. I shall bow deeply in the Japanese
style, so please, lower your sword.

00:22:43.700 --> 00:22:46.700
No! Please! You'll slit
the costume <i>and</i> my throat!

00:22:46.700 --> 00:22:52.370
You listen here. There are three
things I will never, <i>ever</i> wear.

00:22:52.370 --> 00:22:56.200
Number one on that list is animal-ear headbands.

00:22:56.200 --> 00:22:58.000
Understand? Now fix it.

00:22:58.000 --> 00:23:01.080
They're growing out of your head--
they don't come off.

00:23:01.080 --> 00:23:05.250
But I <i>think</i> they'll be gone by nightfall...
in about ten hours.

00:23:05.250 --> 00:23:08.910
Oh, that doesn't count
any time you're logged out.

00:23:08.910 --> 00:23:11.040
Because that's no fun.

00:23:11.040 --> 00:23:14.200
"No fun," eh, you mad penguin?

00:23:14.200 --> 00:23:18.410
By the way, Ray, I have a favor to ask.

00:23:18.410 --> 00:23:19.700
What is it?

00:23:19.700 --> 00:23:24.000
I'd like to take a screenshot. Of you. Topless.

00:23:27.700 --> 00:23:29.580
Farewell!

00:23:29.580 --> 00:23:31.410
He's fast!

00:23:31.410 --> 00:23:34.250
What was <i>his</i> deal?

00:23:34.250 --> 00:23:36.580
Come to think of it...

00:23:36.580 --> 00:23:39.790
He called me "Ray."

00:23:39.790 --> 00:23:42.450
Did I ever give him my name?

00:23:44.410 --> 00:23:48.370
"La Porte de l'Enfer"

00:23:45.500 --> 00:23:47.000
"La Porte de l'Enfer."
